                                "sense_id": "59cee969-ea22-35f0-8b98-695be616d7f3",
                                "text": "“And if the apartment has been deregulated, using a rent-stabilized lease form, or charging less than $2,000 a month, doesn’t resubject the apartment to regulation.”"
